<title>UK: Britannia BS sets 100 mln stg 10-yr structured FRN.</title>
<headline>Britannia BS sets 100 mln stg 10-yr structured FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated</p>
<p>callable step-up floating-rate issue was announced by lead</p>
<p>manager Lehman Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BRITANNIA BUILDING SOCIETY</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *08.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+40 BP    PAY DATE    08.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.89     FULL FEES   0.40</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL AT PAR AFTER FIVE YEARS AFTER WHICH MARGIN</p>
<p>STEPS</p>
<p>		UP TO 90 B.P.</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
